    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The new deleteMany OR condition is too broad: the second branch matches every WorkflowReminder with retryCount > 1, even when it is not an SMS reminder and even when its scheduledDate is in the future. This changes the endpoint from deleting only expired SMS reminders to deleting unrelated reminders as soon as they exceed one retry. The changed deleteMany cleanup adds retryCount as a standalone OR branch, so the retry cleanup can delete WorkflowReminder rows for other method values instead of keeping the SMS method scope.",
